# name: digitalocean-services
# priority: 8010
# section: vendors
# description: DigitalOcean 云平台与共用服务
# boundary: 仅接住所列产品、地区专表之后的厂商共用范围；按来源更新，忽略进程、IP 和不兼容的正则，不把共用平台当成某个应用
# created-at: 2026-11-22T15:05:24Z
# updated-at: 2026-11-22T15:05:24Z
# source: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MetaCubeX/meta-rules-dat/meta/geo/geosite/classical/digitalocean.list
# canonical-rule-count: 6
# rule-count: 6
# format: quantumult-x
# canonical: rules/loon/8010-digitalocean-services.lsr

host-suffix,digitalocean.com,proxy
host-suffix,digitalocean-ui.com,proxy
host-suffix,digitaloceanspaces.com,proxy
host-suffix,do.co,proxy
host-suffix,nginxconfig.io,proxy
host-suffix,ondigitalocean.com,proxy
